    (witness corner-blob borderline concept
      (relaxed shapes)
      (separates "$Shape8conn from the concept, under each branch of the other choice points: a plain 2x2 shape touches a holed ring at one corner. With 4-connected shapes the ring turns 8 and the square stays 1. With 8-connected shapes the two are one holed shape, and both turn 8.")
